  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "37781112",
      "title": "Exploring the Settings",
      "sourceHash": "4205ea7170d5489c96054e310a1ba3b2ea4439b9bf1b868171076f789e30f97f",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.243,
          "end": 5.43,
          "en": "[Manuel The settings can again be accessed via a command.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.43,
          "end": 9.183,
          "en": "So we add another slash here and now type settings.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 10.526,
          "end": 12.81,
          "en": "We can select the option up here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.81,
          "end": 15.42,
          "en": "And now inside the settings menu,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.42,
          "end": 17.94,
          "en": "there are plenty of options available.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.94,
          "end": 19.8,
          "en": "To make this a bit more structured",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.8,
          "end": 21.24,
          "en": "and not to overwhelming,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.24,
          "end": 25.113,
          "en": "I want to exclude some options at this stage of the course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.07,
          "end": 29.91,
          "en": "These options include the selection of the model.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.91,
          "end": 33.06,
          "en": "As you can see, Midjourney comes with different models,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.06,
          "end": 37.71,
          "en": "just using the latest default model 5.2 in my case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.71,
          "end": 40.38,
          "en": "is totally fine to get started.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.38,
          "end": 42.54,
          "en": "We'll have a closer look at Midjourney models",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.54,
          "end": 46.17,
          "en": "and the differences in the next course module.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.17,
          "end": 49.89,
          "en": "Same thing applies to this Raw Mode and Remix mode options,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.89,
          "end": 51.963,
          "en": "which we'll also skip for the moment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 53.13,
          "end": 56.25,
          "en": "Generally, using the default settings in Midjourney",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 56.25,
          "end": 57.99,
          "en": "is totally fine.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.99,
          "end": 59.88,
          "en": "So in case you played around here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59.88,
          "end": 61.89,
          "en": "and wanna go back to the default ones,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.89,
          "end": 64.713,
          "en": "you can always reset your settings down here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 65.79,
          "end": 67.44,
          "en": "Next to this Reset button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 67.44,
          "end": 69.21000000000001,
          "en": "you can find different modes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 69.21000000000001,
          "end": 71.493,
          "en": "Relax, Fast mode, and Turbo mode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 72.78,
          "end": 75.36,
          "en": "The default mode is the Fast mode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 75.36,
          "end": 78.18,
          "en": "And if you again go back to the official documentation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 78.18,
          "end": 79.413,
          "en": "with the pricing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 81.75,
          "end": 83.4,
          "en": "here, inside the plans,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 83.4,
          "end": 88.2,
          "en": "we can find a dedicated amount of Fast GPU Time,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 88.2,
          "end": 90.453,
          "en": "depending on the plan you are using.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 91.83,
          "end": 95.49000000000001,
          "en": "When using Fast mode, which is the default mode,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 95.49000000000001,
          "end": 98.32,
          "en": "creating an image takes about one minute",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 99.33,
          "end": 102.9,
          "en": "and consumes round about one minute also",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 102.9,
          "end": 107.463,
          "en": "from your available Fast GPU Time of the specific month.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 108.81,
          "end": 112.56,
          "en": "if you change to Turbo mode, consumption will double.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 112.56,
          "end": 115.41,
          "en": "So instead of using one minute of your time,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 115.41,
          "end": 118.05,
          "en": "it will consume two minutes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 118.05,
          "end": 119.37,
          "en": "But at the same time,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 119.37,
          "end": 123.603,
          "en": "creating an image will only take round about 15 seconds.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 124.98,
          "end": 126.33,
          "en": "So that's the core difference",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 126.33,
          "end": 129.18,
          "en": "between this Fast and Turbo mode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 129.18,
          "end": 132.33,
          "en": "Turbo is faster, but takes about twice the amount",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 132.33,
          "end": 134.64,
          "en": "of your Fast GPU Time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 134.64,
          "end": 137.76,
          "en": "And if you run out of your Fast GPU Time,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 137.76,
          "end": 140.73,
          "en": "you will automatically switch to the Relax GPU Time",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 140.73,
          "end": 143.49,
          "en": "for the Standard Plan and above.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 143.49,
          "end": 144.63,
          "en": "For the Basic Plan,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 144.63,
          "end": 147.69,
          "en": "you won't be able to create any new images,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 147.69,
          "end": 150.933,
          "en": "so you will have to purchase extra GPU time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 152.76,
          "end": 155.19,
          "en": "So this is what this whole mode thing down here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 155.19,
          "end": 156.153,
          "en": "is all about.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 157.56,
          "end": 160.68,
          "en": "Variation mode is something we explored already",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 160.68,
          "end": 162.93,
          "en": "when we had a look at the options we have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 162.93,
          "end": 165.42000000000002,
          "en": "for up-scaled images.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 165.42000000000002,
          "end": 168.99,
          "en": "So Very Strong and Very Subtle for the up-scaled image,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 168.99,
          "end": 171.75,
          "en": "is the same thing you can set in your settings",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 171.75,
          "end": 174.45,
          "en": "with Low and High Variation mode",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 174.45,
          "end": 177.9,
          "en": "for the general variation options that you have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 177.9,
          "end": 180.003,
          "en": "once you initially created your grid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 181.14,
          "end": 184.08,
          "en": "So when using these variation options,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 184.08,
          "end": 188.19,
          "en": "either High or Low Variations of initial images",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 188.19,
          "end": 191.583,
          "en": "will be created, depending on your setting here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 193.26,
          "end": 197.22,
          "en": "So variation mode is basically the Vary option",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 197.22,
          "end": 200.19,
          "en": "for entire grid, so to say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 200.19,
          "end": 203.34,
          "en": "And finally, we have this Stylize option here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 203.34,
          "end": 205.983,
          "en": "which is set to medium by default.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 207.36,
          "end": 209.94,
          "en": "And to make things a bit more interesting,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 209.94,
          "end": 214.94,
          "en": "I'll now set Stylize to low first, and now add a new prompt.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 217.02,
          "end": 220.53300000000002,
          "en": "I wanna have a cute dog, wearing a hat and sunglasses.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 221.82,
          "end": 225.24,
          "en": "So this is the Stylize low version now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 225.24,
          "end": 229.29,
          "en": "which is again added as parameter to our prompt.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 229.29,
          "end": 233.22,
          "en": "And now I can simply go to my options once again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 233.22,
          "end": 235.263,
          "en": "and set Stylize to very high.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 237.42000000000002,
          "end": 241.89,
          "en": "And if I now change the option and regenerate this image,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 241.89,
          "end": 245.22,
          "en": "it will still use the Stylize low option",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 245.22,
          "end": 247.17,
          "en": "because our regeneration",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 247.17,
          "end": 249.66,
          "en": "is still based on this initial prompt,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 249.66,
          "end": 252.003,
          "en": "and therefore also on these initial settings.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 252.9,
          "end": 255.72,
          "en": "So in this case, regenerate won't work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 255.72,
          "end": 260.64,
          "en": "So instead, in this case I have to copy/paste my prompt,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 260.64,
          "end": 261.753,
          "en": "which I can do now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 262.98,
          "end": 266.52,
          "en": "So now I'll run this again and this time",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 266.52,
          "end": 270.15,
          "en": "you see we have this stylize 750 parameter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 270.15,
          "end": 272.79,
          "en": "here in this case, we had stylize 50.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 272.79,
          "end": 275.493,
          "en": "This was the low stylize level.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 277.35,
          "end": 279.24,
          "en": "And I think with this example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 279.24,
          "end": 282.753,
          "en": "the impact of the stylize option becomes quite obvious.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 283.98,
          "end": 286.62,
          "en": "The lower the stylize value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 286.62,
          "end": 290.46,
          "en": "the closer Midjourney follows your prompt.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 290.46,
          "end": 294.21,
          "en": "So we simply have a dog wearing a hat and sunglasses.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 294.21,
          "end": 296.82,
          "en": "This hat is a bit more fancy, but besides that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 296.82,
          "end": 298.89,
          "en": "we have a pretty simple background,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 298.89,
          "end": 301.623,
          "en": "simple hat and simple sunglasses.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 302.79,
          "end": 305.25,
          "en": "But with the highly stylized option,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 305.25,
          "end": 308.58,
          "en": "we see this fancy hat in here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 308.58,
          "end": 312.03,
          "en": "We have these flowers here also in the background,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 312.03,
          "end": 315.123,
          "en": "we have this very fancy hat also, right here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 316.05,
          "end": 318.84,
          "en": "We have these orange sunglasses.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 318.84,
          "end": 322.17,
          "en": "So the stylize option simply defines",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 322.17,
          "end": 325.2,
          "en": "how much additional fluff, so to say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 325.2,
          "end": 327.813,
          "en": "Midjourney adds around the initial prompt.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 328.86,
          "end": 331.2,
          "en": "So if you wanna stay close to your prompt",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 331.2,
          "end": 334.40999999999997,
          "en": "and don't want Midjourney to be too creative, so to say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 334.40999999999997,
          "end": 337.563,
          "en": "you simply use the low or medium stylize option.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 338.49,
          "end": 340.65,
          "en": "If things should be a bit more crazy,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 340.65,
          "end": 344.61,
          "en": "you can go to Stylize high or Stylize very high.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 344.61,
          "end": 347.28,
          "en": "I'll simply go back to my initial settings here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 347.28,
          "end": 350.15999999999997,
          "en": "because I think the default settings are pretty fine",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 350.15999999999997,
          "end": 351.963,
          "en": "for many use cases.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 352.8,
          "end": 353.67,
          "en": "So with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 353.67,
          "end": 356.49,
          "en": "if we once again open our settings",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 356.49,
          "end": 358.68,
          "en": "to have these here at the bottom,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 358.68,
          "end": 360.84,
          "en": "we had a look at many options,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 360.84,
          "end": 364.113,
          "en": "but now I wanna dive into this Public mode here.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ],
